- op: discuss  # babd
  at: '2026-09-01T07:13:01Z'  # babd
  by: agent  # babd
  actor: jgstern_agent  # babd
  clock: 4  # babd
  nonce: babd  # babd
  message: "FIXED in PR #684 (dev 6cca459732), for all seven languages rather than python alone.\n\n`strip_redundant_module_qualifier` in io_boundary drops a leading qualifier the\nmodule slot already carries; `classify_call_in_catalog` and taint's\n`_match_propagation_entry` / `match_source` / `match_sink` retry on the bare name\nSTRICTLY AFTER the qualified lookup has missed, so no call that matched before can\nbe re-pointed. Both consumers call the one helper, and\n`_UNRESOLVED_MODULE_PLACEHOLDERS` moved to io_boundary as its canonical home with\ntaint re-exporting it, so the two cannot drift.\n\nThe head is compared COMPONENT-WISE against the hint's tail rather than for\nequality, because the slots are written at different depths (java's edge says\n`System` where the row says `java.lang.System`) -- a bare equality test would have\nfixed python and missed java, which is how this and INV-fofoj's java half came to\nbe filed as two items.\n\nMEASURED, 21-repo / 10-language cohort, every repo cold in its own\nXDG_CACHE_HOME: 58 boundaries added, 0 removed (removed=0 is the success\ncondition, not added=0). All added rows read back against source: java\nSystem.out x51 / System.err x3, python datetime.now x4 --\n`System.out.println(res1)` at jedis BitMapsExample.java:25,\n`datetime.now(timezone.utc)` at postgrest test_auth.py:225.\n\nThe gates still refuse the traps after unqualification, which is what keeps a\nrecall fix from becoming a precision loss: os.path, ./constants.open,\n../js/phoenix/ajax.request, sre_constants.error, urllib.parse and reflect.String\nall still resolve to None.\n\n11,839 tests pass, 100% coverage on both changed files, mypy ratchet clean.\n\nRESIDUAL, stated rather than closed over: this fixes the LOOKUP, not the\nEMISSION. The analyzers still write the qualifier into both slots, so the doubled\nkey remains in the persisted IR and any future consumer that composes\nmodule + \".\" + name will hit it again. Fixing the producers changes emitted symbol\nids and so carries stable_id churn behind the v9/v10 scheme gate -- deliberately\nnot bundled with a recall fix."  # babd
